# C — finance, USD, accrual (US GAAP), fiscal year 1 July to 30 June. Audited statements for 2024-25 and for the first period (2023-09-30 to 2024-06-30, as restated in the
# 2024-25 report, which moved all contributions to "with donor restrictions"). "net-income" is the change in net assets. The 2024 Form 990 differs a little from the audit
# (revenue $33.3M, expenses $5.6M for 2024-25). Plans are budgets, not results.
